1
00:00:04,940 --> 00:00:07,060
You're a Poisoner, Dio Brando.

2
00:00:07,260 --> 00:00:09,966
I have all the proof I
require, and then some!

3
00:00:14,040 --> 00:00:16,877
He's found his proof, so be it.

4
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:19,857
This moment's been a
long time coming, JoJo.

5
00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:22,880
Now, I finish what I started!

6
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:36,740
Let's go.

7
00:01:22,600 --> 00:01:26,697
I'm the star-sponsor of the world?.

8
00:01:26,780 --> 00:01:29,557
and I'll keep you together!.

9
00:01:29,640 --> 00:01:35,340
I'm the star-sponsor of the world!.

10
00:01:36,720 --> 00:01:41,237
The star-sponsor of the world!.

11
00:01:41,320 --> 00:01:43,957
The star-sponsor

12
00:01:44,040 --> 00:01:51,040
of

13
00:01:52,580 --> 00:01:53,410
the

14
00:01:53,493 --> 00:01:54,323
world?.

15
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:01,020
I tracked down the antidote.

16
00:02:01,960 --> 00:02:03,660
Father took it moments ago.

17
00:02:05,840 --> 00:02:08,020
Dio, this pains me greatly.

18
00:02:08,460 --> 00:02:12,877
For years, you were my brother, and now
I have no recourse but to turn you in.

19
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:13,820
I'm sorry.

20
00:02:14,160 --> 00:02:18,880
Really, I'm sure you don't believe a word
of it, but I'm telling you the truth.

21
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:23,640
Even now you show compassion

22
00:02:27,200 --> 00:02:30,577
Jojo I've been a devil
but grant me this one wish

23
00:02:30,660 --> 00:02:34,657
allow me to do the right
thing for once in my life And

24
00:02:34,740 --> 00:02:39,597
turn myself in what's this
I thought once I confronted

25
00:02:39,680 --> 00:02:42,915
him he'd fight me tooth and
nail like a cornered beast.

26
00:02:43,860 --> 00:02:44,690
Jojo,

27
00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:47,820
you should be dead in a gutter right? now.

28
00:02:48,100 --> 00:02:51,688
I must distract him long enough
with a knife and mask to find

29
00:02:51,820 --> 00:02:52,650
their mark.

30
00:02:52,733 --> 00:02:54,340
My wicked deeds gnaw at me.

31
00:02:54,540 --> 00:02:59,422
The poverty I Knew as a child ate away at
my moral compass until greed was all that

32
00:02:59,820 --> 00:03:00,650
remained.

33
00:03:00,733 --> 00:03:01,840
I'm the lowest of the low.

34
00:03:02,060 --> 00:03:06,277
Your father took me in off the street
and I repaid his kindness with poison.

35
00:03:06,360 --> 00:03:09,419
The only reason I came back
was to surrender myself.

36
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:13,597
If I'd wanted to flee, You never
would have laid eyes on me again.

37
00:03:13,680 --> 00:03:14,880
I see your point.

38
00:03:15,520 --> 00:03:17,680
Please allow me to make amends.

39
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:19,230
Deal.

40
00:03:19,313 --> 00:03:20,628
Look alive, Master Joestar.

41
00:03:20,980 --> 00:03:23,392
He's trying to lure you in like he's not.

42
00:03:24,300 --> 00:03:27,297
Right about now, you're
probably wondering who I am.

43
00:03:27,380 --> 00:03:28,909
Allow me to elucidate you.

44
00:03:29,260 --> 00:03:31,900
The name is Robert E .O. Speedwagon.

45
00:03:32,160 --> 00:03:35,317
I had a hunch Jonathan's run
of trouble might not be done,

46
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:36,717
so I followed him back home.

47
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:41,560
I like you, Jonathan, so I'm going to
offer up this little tidbit pro bono.

48
00:03:41,740 --> 00:03:42,975
Living in the gutter,

49
00:03:43,120 --> 00:03:46,717
you learn to spot lowlights pretty
quick if you want to see tomorrow.

50
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:51,217
I've trained my nose to sort out the bad
ones from the good just from a sniff.

51
00:03:51,300 --> 00:03:56,180
This Fool reeks of brimstone and blood
worse than anyone I've ever laid eyes on.

52
00:03:56,560 --> 00:04:00,040
He is pure evil, right
down to his very bones.

53
00:04:00,500 --> 00:04:03,237
Is he a victim of
circumstance, you're wondering?

54
00:04:03,320 --> 00:04:04,277
Not on your life!

55
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:07,140
He's been evil since he
drew his first breath.

56
00:04:08,880 --> 00:04:13,340
But don't you fret, because I
brought you a friend. Remember him?

57
00:04:15,220 --> 00:04:18,985
This man confessed to selling you
the poison you used on Father.

58
00:04:20,400 --> 00:04:21,580
I've heard enough.

59
00:04:23,340 --> 00:04:24,840
You break my heart.

60
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:31,480
Why, dear, from the day you arrived, I have
loved you as though you were my own son.

61
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:38,900
Father you're too weak to be down here
you're right i'll return to my chamber.

62
00:04:40,400 --> 00:04:43,797
I don't want to see my
boy in chains do what

63
00:04:43,880 --> 00:04:48,937
you must Jojo i will is
this how it all ends?

64
00:04:49,020 --> 00:04:52,897
He won't see the inside
of a cell this night i

65
00:04:52,980 --> 00:04:56,100
read his face and the
trio of moors on his ear.

66
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:59,660
The devil smiles on him
and grants him luck.

67
00:05:02,660 --> 00:05:06,560
Jojo, I want you to be the
one to put the cuffs on me.

68
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:08,400
Please, brother.

69
00:05:09,420 --> 00:05:10,250
All right.

70
00:05:11,620 --> 00:05:14,020
Be careful, he's a crafty one.

71
00:05:14,420 --> 00:05:18,620
Jojo, it was hubris that led
me to this ignominious end.

72
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:22,680
This fall from grace has taught me well.

73
00:05:23,240 --> 00:05:26,237
However one may scheme and dissemble,

74
00:05:26,320 --> 00:05:29,496
my downfall this night is
part of the human condition.

75
00:05:29,820 --> 00:05:32,500
A condition I now forsake.

76
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:34,620
Wait, forsake? What do you mean?

77
00:05:34,900 --> 00:05:38,880
You see, I am about to
become so much more!

78
00:05:40,200 --> 00:05:42,420
Help me shed this mortal skin!

79
00:05:42,840 --> 00:05:44,420
Mother's mask? But how?

80
00:05:44,780 --> 00:05:45,720
Watch out!

81
00:05:45,980 --> 00:05:47,100
Fire at will, man!

82
00:05:47,220 --> 00:05:49,260
Jojo, your blood is the key!

83
00:05:55,400 --> 00:05:56,840
Oh, my God!

84
00:05:57,500 --> 00:05:58,380
Fulver!

85
00:06:09,780 --> 00:06:11,340
Shoot that maniac!

86
00:06:27,520 --> 00:06:28,350
Jojo.

87
00:06:29,760 --> 00:06:30,590
Father.

88
00:06:32,640 --> 00:06:34,200
This is all my fault.

89
00:06:34,440 --> 00:06:36,322
I should have blocked his knife.

90
00:06:36,700 --> 00:06:37,640
The mask.

91
00:06:37,840 --> 00:06:39,500
When I saw it, I froze up.

92
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:41,720
And you paid the price.

93
00:06:45,200 --> 00:06:46,420
Take this ring.

94
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:49,980
It was your mother's, Jojo.

95
00:06:51,200 --> 00:06:52,030
Father.

96
00:06:53,100 --> 00:06:53,930
Damn it!

97
00:06:54,040 --> 00:06:56,197
Ain't a doctor on Earth who can fix that.

98
00:06:56,280 --> 00:06:58,177
How'd that devil get the drop on us?

99
00:06:58,260 --> 00:06:59,337
It's all my fault!

100
00:06:59,420 --> 00:07:02,126
If only I hadn't listened
to you, Sir Joestar!

101
00:07:03,260 --> 00:07:07,077
If I had run his father out of town
years ago like I'd have mind to,

102
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:10,880
none of this would have taken
place! Hold on. Whose father?

103
00:07:11,940 --> 00:07:13,999
Back when I first joined the Force,

104
00:07:14,140 --> 00:07:16,277
there was a ne 'er-do-well
who tried to pawn

105
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:19,280
that very ring you now
see on Joestar's finger.

106
00:07:19,900 --> 00:07:23,900
The suspect was Dio's
birth father, Dario Brando.

107
00:07:25,700 --> 00:07:27,818
It's mine, of that there's no doubt.

108
00:07:28,240 --> 00:07:32,040
My late wife and I had them
made to celebrate our betrothal.

109
00:07:32,340 --> 00:07:36,580
A local cut purse by the name of
Dario Brando was trying to sell it.

110
00:07:38,020 --> 00:07:39,200
Can it be?

111
00:07:39,980 --> 00:07:44,520
Sir Joestar thought he owed his life
to Dario, but he was sadly mistaken.

112
00:07:45,360 --> 00:07:47,737
Dario hadn't scrambled down to the mangled

113
00:07:47,820 --> 00:07:50,357
carriage that fateful night
to look for survivors,

114
00:07:50,440 --> 00:07:52,560
but to root for ill-gotten riches.

115
00:07:54,260 --> 00:07:55,560
You stay back!

116
00:07:56,820 --> 00:07:59,340
This man, what has he said, Inspector?

117
00:07:59,880 --> 00:08:02,586
Did he ever tell you
that I gave him the ring?

118
00:08:02,740 --> 00:08:04,540
Aye, he swore up and down.

119
00:08:04,760 --> 00:08:05,900
You filthy liar!

120
00:08:06,160 --> 00:08:07,900
He swore with good reason.

121
00:08:08,260 --> 00:08:10,617
I gave him the ring, just as he told you.

122
00:08:10,700 --> 00:08:12,288
You have got to be kidding!

123
00:08:13,500 --> 00:08:14,600
He is innocent.

124
00:08:15,040 --> 00:08:17,120
Let him go at once, Inspector.

125
00:08:17,580 --> 00:08:19,840
But, sir, this man stole from you.

126
00:08:20,020 --> 00:08:24,840
But for Providence's hand in my life,
I might as well have done the same.

127
00:08:27,140 --> 00:08:30,660
Sell this ring, if you may ease
your family's burden by it.

128
00:08:31,660 --> 00:08:35,540
Walk an honest path henceforth,
and I give it gladly.

129
00:08:37,860 --> 00:08:40,637
He knew he didn't owe Dario a damn thing.

130
00:08:40,720 --> 00:08:42,997
And he took Dio in all the same.

131
00:08:43,080 --> 00:08:45,317
Father, hang on.

132
00:08:45,400 --> 00:08:47,560
The doctor's on his way now.

133
00:08:48,940 --> 00:08:51,497
Jojo, don't hate Dio for what he's done.

134
00:08:51,580 --> 00:08:53,840
I am to blame for this.

135
00:08:54,880 --> 00:08:56,357
I was hard on you.

136
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:58,397
Because you were a Joestar.

137
00:08:58,480 --> 00:09:00,877
I went too easy on Dio.

138
00:09:00,960 --> 00:09:03,240
And he might have felt I didn't care.

139
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:07,520
Perhaps he did this for
want of a father's love.

140
00:09:08,280 --> 00:09:09,110
Please.

141
00:09:09,193 --> 00:09:10,877
See that he's buried.

142
00:09:10,960 --> 00:09:12,700
Next to Dario.

143
00:09:14,500 --> 00:09:15,330
Father.

144
00:09:19,060 --> 00:09:21,197
Don't look so sad, Jojo.

145
00:09:21,280 --> 00:09:26,820
We're better to die Than
in the arms Of my son.

146
00:09:33,840 --> 00:09:35,040
The Joestar!

147
00:09:37,560 --> 00:09:39,660
We have lost much this night.

148
00:09:40,460 --> 00:09:44,240
A noble man's soul has
been taken from the world.

149
00:09:44,800 --> 00:09:45,740
You're wrong!

150
00:09:46,080 --> 00:09:49,727
All that was good in that man,
he passed it along to Jonathan?

151
00:09:49,980 --> 00:09:51,020
every bit of it!

152
00:09:51,480 --> 00:09:55,000
You can be sure, Jojo's
gonna live an upright life?

153
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:56,944
using what his father gave him.

154
00:09:57,640 --> 00:09:59,000
Rich folks are rubbish.

155
00:09:59,300 --> 00:10:03,157
Watching them flounce around, I wanna throw
the whole lot of them into the Thames.

156
00:10:03,240 --> 00:10:05,320
But not the Joestars.

157
00:10:05,860 --> 00:10:11,040
The heroic and merciful and just the
whole damn lot are giants among men.

158
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:15,060
What the hell?

159
00:10:15,440 --> 00:10:16,340
The body!

160
00:10:16,920 --> 00:10:18,277
Dio's corpse, it...

161
00:10:18,360 --> 00:10:19,420
It vanished!

162
00:10:21,680 --> 00:10:22,600
Oi, Grip!

163
00:10:23,080 --> 00:10:24,315
Away from the window!

164
00:10:45,520 --> 00:10:46,480
The inspector!

165
00:10:48,520 --> 00:10:50,280
No, that's impossible.

166
00:10:50,640 --> 00:10:51,581
How is he alive?

167
00:10:51,740 --> 00:10:52,570
It can't be.

168
00:10:52,653 --> 00:10:54,500
We all filled him full of bullets.

169
00:10:54,980 --> 00:10:56,357
Keep your distance, lads.

170
00:10:56,440 --> 00:10:57,969
He's armed with something.

171
00:11:00,800 --> 00:11:01,960
Was it the mosque?

172
00:11:04,300 --> 00:11:05,940
He's coming right at us!

173
00:11:06,080 --> 00:11:07,277
What are you waiting for?

174
00:11:07,360 --> 00:11:09,477
Hit him with everything you've got left!

175
00:11:09,560 --> 00:11:10,840
Come no closer!

176
00:11:14,700 --> 00:11:16,220
Not another step!

177
00:11:16,400 --> 00:11:17,240
I mean it!

178
00:11:18,500 --> 00:11:20,280
Blow his brains out now!

179
00:11:20,560 --> 00:11:22,440
Do it before he kills us all!

180
00:11:51,960 --> 00:11:54,817
Shot him in the head and it
didn't even slow him down.

181
00:11:54,900 --> 00:11:56,797
It doesn't make any sense!

182
00:11:56,880 --> 00:12:00,417
With all the lead we put in him
he should be worm food by now.

183
00:12:00,500 --> 00:12:02,500
How can this be?

184
00:12:04,740 --> 00:12:08,820
Jojo, I should thank you for
the source of my newfound power,

185
00:12:09,220 --> 00:12:12,540
your father's blood, and the ancient mask.

186
00:12:19,580 --> 00:12:22,860
He takes his very life,
but how is that possible?

187
00:12:23,740 --> 00:12:24,820
Dio, you villain.

188
00:12:25,280 --> 00:12:27,456
What sort of monster have you become?

189
00:12:39,720 --> 00:12:41,260
How did this happen?

190
00:12:41,660 --> 00:12:43,020
Think, Jojo, think!

191
00:12:44,520 --> 00:12:46,840
The knife, father, blood,

192
00:12:47,240 --> 00:12:51,580
Dio, the mask, my notes, the brain,
unknown abilities, unknown strength!

193
00:12:51,960 --> 00:12:54,400
There is nothing human left of you, Dio!

194
00:13:10,620 --> 00:13:11,960
Don't do it, Jojo!

195
00:13:12,400 --> 00:13:14,057
You haven't got a chance in hell!

196
00:13:14,140 --> 00:13:16,317
I've never seen anything like this lad.

197
00:13:16,400 --> 00:13:20,106
He broke those coppers to pieces
like they were fleeting twigs!

198
00:13:20,460 --> 00:13:21,290
I know.

199
00:13:22,840 --> 00:13:24,360
Honestly, I'm terrified.

200
00:13:24,780 --> 00:13:28,120
All the same, I can't
let Dio kill anyone else!

201
00:13:28,320 --> 00:13:30,360
This demon must be annihilated!

202
00:13:30,640 --> 00:13:32,228
Please, Jojo, I beg of you!

203
00:13:32,360 --> 00:13:33,595
He'll tear you apart!

204
00:13:34,680 --> 00:13:35,510
That's it.

205
00:13:35,740 --> 00:13:37,916
According to my research on the mask,

206
00:13:38,040 --> 00:13:41,037
it was fabled to unlock the
brain's hidden potential.

207
00:13:41,120 --> 00:13:43,580
To vanquish Dio, all I have to do is...

208
00:13:52,800 --> 00:13:54,180
This one's alive.

209
00:13:54,300 --> 00:13:55,160
Your blood.

210
00:13:56,200 --> 00:13:58,080
It smells so delicious.

211
00:14:04,860 --> 00:14:09,220
Now, I'm going to turn you inside out.

212
00:14:21,520 --> 00:14:22,880
He was my brother.

213
00:14:23,160 --> 00:14:25,040
Look at him now, father.

214
00:14:25,740 --> 00:14:28,460
Please lend me the
strength to do what I must.

215
00:14:31,340 --> 00:14:32,257
Courage, Jojo.

216
00:14:32,340 --> 00:14:35,140
Dio is powerful, but
you know how to end him.

217
00:14:35,340 --> 00:14:36,860
And end him you must!

218
00:14:37,240 --> 00:14:38,240
Watch out!

219
00:14:40,140 --> 00:14:41,020
It's over!

220
00:14:41,260 --> 00:14:44,440
I'm not going to let you
kill anyone else! Dio!

221
00:14:48,360 --> 00:14:50,160
He caught the sword and spear.

222
00:14:50,960 --> 00:14:53,784
Right through the hand
and he don't even flinch.

223
00:14:54,420 --> 00:14:57,177
No way, the hole from where
I shot him in the head?

224
00:14:57,260 --> 00:14:58,637
It's healed up.

225
00:14:58,720 --> 00:15:00,717
That spear ain't gonna hurt him.

226
00:15:00,800 --> 00:15:01,940
He's immortal.

227
00:15:05,560 --> 00:15:07,800
You're such a weakling, Jojo?

228
00:15:15,940 --> 00:15:17,980
On your feet, insect.

229
00:15:18,440 --> 00:15:21,780
I've yet to gauge the full
extent of my new powers.

230
00:15:22,020 --> 00:15:24,500
So let's play a little longer, shall we?

231
00:15:24,920 --> 00:15:29,100
I trust you'll be long since dead
by the time I figure them out.

232
00:15:31,880 --> 00:15:33,320
Hiding, are we?

233
00:15:48,040 --> 00:15:50,077
You were a fool to attack me.

234
00:15:50,160 --> 00:15:54,600
I have disowned my weakness
in favor of life everlasting.

235
00:15:55,540 --> 00:15:58,517
You're behind the curtain
like Polonius and like

236
00:15:58,600 --> 00:16:01,541
Polonius it is there that
you shall meet your end!

237
00:16:06,760 --> 00:16:09,300
No one's immortal not even you.

238
00:16:17,520 --> 00:16:20,617
He's able to heal faster
than the flames can hurt him.

239
00:16:20,700 --> 00:16:23,500
If that ain't immortality,
then I'm the queen.

240
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:26,040
Fire hurts him, but not enough.

241
00:16:33,680 --> 00:16:35,360
Jojo, what are you doing?

242
00:16:35,660 --> 00:16:37,484
Just get to safety, Speedwagon.

243
00:16:37,800 --> 00:16:40,447
If Dio wants a fight,
I mean to give him one.

244
00:16:57,800 --> 00:16:58,717
What are you doing?

245
00:16:58,800 --> 00:16:59,630
Are you mad?

246
00:16:59,713 --> 00:17:02,120
The flames are gonna box you in up there!

247
00:17:06,700 --> 00:17:08,157
Jojo, you brave fool!

248
00:17:08,240 --> 00:17:10,300
I hope to hell you've got a plan?

249
00:17:15,120 --> 00:17:16,920
I'm waiting for you, Dio.

250
00:17:25,300 --> 00:17:26,320
Know this!

251
00:17:26,540 --> 00:17:27,580
It ends here!

252
00:17:27,760 --> 00:17:30,417
I will not allow you to
leave this mansion alive!

253
00:17:30,500 --> 00:17:31,680
No! That's lunacy!

254
00:17:38,280 --> 00:17:40,500
Luring me away from the Gutter Rat.

255
00:17:40,920 --> 00:17:42,960
How very noble of you.

256
00:17:43,740 --> 00:17:44,760
No matter.

257
00:17:48,240 --> 00:17:52,946
I'll drain you dry, and your blood will
help me mend from this little adventure.

258
00:17:55,740 --> 00:18:00,180
You climb the wall in vain, Jojo,
in your haste to flee from me.

259
00:18:00,380 --> 00:18:02,851
All you have done is guaranteed your doom.

260
00:18:03,500 --> 00:18:07,480
You will be consumed tonight
by the inferno below, or by me!

261
00:18:11,040 --> 00:18:11,870
Father.

262
00:18:17,420 --> 00:18:19,460
Father, rest in peace.

263
00:18:19,900 --> 00:18:22,700
Let the rising smoke
guide your soul to heaven.

264
00:18:24,040 --> 00:18:27,820
But first, please, lend me
your aid one final time.

265
00:18:28,440 --> 00:18:31,240
Let the fire burn with your strength.

266
00:18:34,480 --> 00:18:36,892
What does he mean to accomplish up there?

267
00:18:38,600 --> 00:18:39,900
No, that's crazy!

268
00:18:40,200 --> 00:18:41,777
You're throwing your life away!

269
00:18:41,860 --> 00:18:42,690
Don't do it!

270
00:18:42,773 --> 00:18:44,140
Don't do it, Jojo!

271
00:18:48,740 --> 00:18:50,080
Any moment now.

272
00:18:58,880 --> 00:18:59,710
Useless!

273
00:18:59,793 --> 00:19:01,798
You fight as though you want to die!

274
00:19:02,060 --> 00:19:06,020
In that moment, Jojo's short
life flashed before his eyes.

275
00:19:15,940 --> 00:19:18,680
My lonely youth, my time with Dio.

276
00:19:19,380 --> 00:19:23,600
You did me wrong time and again,
so now I'll settle the score.

277
00:19:24,640 --> 00:19:28,820
The longer the fire burns, the
hotter it gets, and Jojo knows it.

278
00:19:29,380 --> 00:19:32,557
He means to use the mansion
as a funeral pyre and

279
00:19:32,640 --> 00:19:35,557
burn the devil faster than
he can replenish himself.

280
00:19:35,640 --> 00:19:40,340
And now that the house is hot enough,
he's going to knock him back in.

281
00:19:42,040 --> 00:19:42,870
Jojo!

282
00:19:47,040 --> 00:19:50,340
How dare you lay your
hands on me, you insect!

283
00:19:50,680 --> 00:19:54,386
The only home I've ever known
will be in ashes before the dawn.

284
00:19:55,220 --> 00:19:57,540
Father is dead, and I am alone.

285
00:19:58,240 --> 00:20:02,640
I have nothing left to
lose, but my life itself.

286
00:20:04,140 --> 00:20:06,540
We go to the flames together, Dio!

287
00:20:06,800 --> 00:20:10,120
I'll gladly die if it
means an end to your evil!

288
00:20:12,580 --> 00:20:14,400
Die for nothing, fool!

289
00:20:16,780 --> 00:20:20,520
All I lose by your sacrifice is
the blood I would have taken.

290
00:20:21,000 --> 00:20:24,706
Blacken and burn among the bones
of your damnable father, Jojo!

291
00:20:26,660 --> 00:20:28,840
I am a god in all but name.

292
00:20:29,040 --> 00:20:32,260
With the powers at my command,
I will rule this world.

293
00:20:32,520 --> 00:20:34,920
Thank you, brother, for this great boon.

294
00:20:47,820 --> 00:20:48,700
Damn it!

295
00:20:53,260 --> 00:20:54,090
Dio!

296
00:20:54,440 --> 00:20:56,120
I'm not done with you!

297
00:20:56,360 --> 00:20:58,140
Why won't you die already?

298
00:21:00,220 --> 00:21:02,440
There's no escape, Dio!

299
00:21:02,660 --> 00:21:04,954
You've brought this doom upon yourself!

300
00:21:05,140 --> 00:21:07,517
This is the knife you
used to kill my father!

301
00:21:07,600 --> 00:21:12,080
So as you did to the man who
raised us both, I now do unto you!

302
00:21:21,960 --> 00:21:25,757
I've crushed his arm bones to
splinters, and he's already ablaze?

303
00:21:25,840 --> 00:21:28,440
but his grip on me is
still that of a vice!

304
00:21:29,060 --> 00:21:30,660
So be it, Jojo.

305
00:21:31,240 --> 00:21:35,877
Consign us both unto the flames, but
perish knowing I will survive this moment?

306
00:21:35,960 --> 00:21:37,517
for everything you have done.

307
00:21:37,600 --> 00:21:40,440
Even this inferno cannot devour me!

308
00:21:43,220 --> 00:21:45,280
Fulmer, lend me your power!

309
00:21:46,480 --> 00:21:48,920
His desperate cry echoed in the night.

310
00:21:49,180 --> 00:21:53,500
Whether urged on by his departed
father or heeding an instinct,

311
00:21:53,780 --> 00:21:57,357
born of a long familiarity with
the home which burned around him?

312
00:21:57,440 --> 00:22:01,737
he kicked, and that put
them right in line with...

313
00:22:01,820 --> 00:22:03,260
What the?

314
00:22:04,720 --> 00:22:08,480
The statue of the Joestar
family's guardian angel.

315
00:22:11,940 --> 00:22:14,940
How could a worm like you?

316
00:22:17,100 --> 00:22:20,000
I forgot who I was dealing with.

317
00:22:20,440 --> 00:22:24,120
Bloody his nose, and he
comes back twice as fierce.

318
00:22:26,180 --> 00:22:27,010
Jojo!

319
00:22:27,840 --> 00:22:31,017
I had such plans for this world.

320
00:22:31,100 --> 00:22:33,460
on such plans!

321
00:22:41,100 --> 00:22:41,930
JoJo!

322
00:22:46,100 --> 00:22:46,930
It's over.

323
00:22:47,013 --> 00:22:47,843
You're alive.

324
00:22:48,860 --> 00:22:51,080
You lucky bastard.

325
00:22:51,620 --> 00:22:52,900
He did it!

326
00:22:54,100 --> 00:22:55,680
JoJo bested him!

327
00:23:06,720 --> 00:23:09,817
I'll be the roundabout.

328
00:23:09,900 --> 00:23:13,977
The words will make you out and out.

329
00:23:14,060 --> 00:23:17,640
I'll spend the day your way.

330
00:23:19,320 --> 00:23:22,077
Call it morning, driving through the sun.

331
00:23:22,160 --> 00:23:23,720
And in and out the valley.

332
00:23:33,620 --> 00:23:36,837
The music dance and sing.

333
00:23:36,920 --> 00:23:41,017
They make the children really ring.

334
00:23:41,100 --> 00:23:44,860
I spend the day your way.

335
00:23:46,400 --> 00:23:49,157
Call it morning, driving through the sun.

336
00:23:49,240 --> 00:23:50,860
And in and out the valley.

337
00:23:52,980 --> 00:23:55,620
In and around the lake.

338
00:23:56,720 --> 00:23:59,017
Miles come out of the sky.

339
00:23:59,100 --> 00:24:00,680
And they'll stand there.

340
00:24:03,860 --> 00:24:05,177
One mile over.

341
00:24:05,260 --> 00:24:07,500
We'll be there and we'll see you.

342
00:24:10,260 --> 00:24:11,717
Ten and two summers.

343
00:24:11,800 --> 00:24:13,840
We'll be there and laughing too.

344
00:24:16,760 --> 00:24:18,717
Twenty, forty, five mile.

345
00:24:18,800 --> 00:24:22,220
But we'll see, I'll be there with you!

346
00:24:40,800 --> 00:24:41,860
There it is.

347
00:25:01,040 --> 00:25:03,017
Courage is to look your fear in the eye!

348
00:25:03,100 --> 00:25:06,060
Dio's evil, yeah, but
this guy is far worse!

349
00:25:06,220 --> 00:25:07,740
Prepare for the carnage!

350
00:25:07,900 --> 00:25:09,018
Who do I look like?

351
00:25:09,140 --> 00:25:11,560
I beg of you, teach me how to wield it.
